<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>Reset Your Password</title>
</head>

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 30px;">
  <div style="max-width: 550px; margin: auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 8px;">

    <h2>Hello {{name}},</h2>

    <p>
      We received a request to reset your Marto Marketplace account password.
    </p>

    <p>
      Click the button below to create a new password:
    </p>

    <a
      href="{{resetUrl}}"
      style="display: inline-block; background-color: #111827; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;"
    >
      Reset Password
    </a>

    <p style="margin-top: 25px;">
      This link will expire in 1 hour.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you did not request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #777;">
      Marto Marketplace
    </p>

  </div>
</body>
</html>